    <item>
      <title>Climbing Kids</title>
      <link>https://hughandbecky.us/kids/katja/post/climbing-kids/</link>
      <pubDate>Sat, 17 Jun 2023 12:19:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://hughandbecky.us/kids/katja/post/climbing-kids/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;I took my kids climbing today. It was an early morning with a 7:15 am departure. Becky was there to cheer us on. Managing two active kids and setting top ropes is just beyond my current capacity. This was Hugh’s first time climbing with ropes. Katja, much more experienced has moved from being satisfied with half an assent to cheering when topping a route.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;img_9489.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;&#34; /&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;img_9486.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;&#34; /&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;img_9485.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;&#34; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    
